```

## Investigation Guidelines

1. **Explore first** - Understand the project structure
2. **Follow the trail** - Trace code paths and dependencies
3. **Document as you go** - Update FINDINGS.md continuously
4. **Note dead ends** - Document what didn't work (saves time later)
